# The sporadic branch of the rank-one reduction

The public interface supplies the intrinsic local configuration, the
central-cover transfer needed for the upstairs contradiction, and the M₁₁
exclusion from its semidihedral Sylow subgroup. The other eight exclusions
and the M₁₂ centralizer calculation remain separate proof obligations.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith, 15.3.43, printed p.1140; the exact model list is
1.1.5(3)(f), printed p.502 (combined manuscript of 1 March 2004).
-/
